+C++/thread runtimes. Retain all supplied license/exception notices when
+packaging this DLL: GODOT-CPP-LICENSE.txt, GCC-COPYING3.txt,
+GCC-RUNTIME-EXCEPTION.txt, MINGW-CRT-LICENSE.txt, WINPTHREADS-LICENSE.txt.
